Package: lucidgrasp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: High-performance image search engine
 LucidGrasp is a high-performance image search engine that matches visual
 media by combining SSIM structural similarity, ORB keypoint matching, and
 color histogram intersection into a single similarity percentage. It indexes
 local folders (up to an entire filesystem) and finds visually similar images,
 including edited versions that have been color graded, contrast adjusted, or
 had filters applied.